FUN_004203dc: contiguous camera-relative position vector (scattered-locals)

The camera-transform setup subtracts the camera position from the object position into
THREE SEPARATE int locals (local_20/local_1c/local_18) and passes &local_20 to
ApplyMatrixLV, which reads param_2[0..2] as a contiguous vector -- layout-dependent UB
under our compilers. Result: the transformed camera position DAT_0075424e (and thus
TRANSVEC @0x74c702, gdb-verified z=0x1ac93400 garbage) was matrix x stack-junk ->
every otz wild -> the post-FIX-Q whole-map OT-splice crashes. Same scattered-locals
class as patches 330/335/415.

